{"seq":1213,"lane":"A","class":"lost-uncertainty","severity":"minor","evidence":"1213.json: “The company also provided early unofficial fiscal 2028 guidance with revenue expected to be up 70% year-over-year.” A’s stored summary says “an early FY2028 revenue-growth forecast” without “unofficial”.","rule":"Signed standard §5.2 and §5.4: preserve uncertainty and conditions in a standalone evidence record.","mechanism":"A’s summary compresses the source’s qualification; record preparation preserves that summary without checking whether the qualification survived."}
{"seq":1213,"lane":"matching","class":"same-article-evidence-duplicated","severity":"serious","evidence":"1213.json: A records “revenue expected to be up 70% year-over-year” and “more than 100% year-over-year in fiscal 2028 if not for supply constraints” for v72; B records both statements together for v2. _ledger.json stores A’s passages as e4247 and e4248 and B’s combined passage as e4250.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and D250: one research matter in one article is one record; the record can link to relevant questions.","mechanism":"A and B run against the same prior snapshot and hand their overlapping passages to the writer separately; matching compares B’s record within its existing question, not against A’s new-question passages."}
{"seq":1213,"lane":"matching","class":"invented-statement-date","severity":"serious","evidence":"1213.json: “Nvidia recently reported second-quarter financial results that beat analyst estimates.” has original_day “”, but matching records said_day “2026-08-29” for e3.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and §5.4 and D203: an unknown original statement date remains unknown and is not filled with the article’s publication date.","mechanism":"src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:265 substitutes the publication day and presents it to the matcher as the date the source stated the information. The stored original_day remains empty, but the matching input and decision carry the unsupported date."}
{"seq":1216,"lane":"matching","class":"invented-statement-date","severity":"serious","evidence":"1216.json: “NVIDIA officially announced DLSS 5 in March and has only committed to a fall 2026 release.” has original_day “”, while matching records said_day “2026-08-29” for e2.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and §5.4 and D203: do not substitute the publication day for an unknown original statement date.","mechanism":"src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:265 substitutes the publication day before constructing the matcher’s stated-date field; the article identifies the announcement as having occurred in March."}
{"seq":1217,"lane":"matching","class":"invented-statement-date","severity":"serious","evidence":"1217.json: “NVIDIA … brought in US$96.2bn in revenue, beating Wall Street expectations of US$92bn in the second quarter” has original_day “”, but matching records said_day “2026-08-29” for e1.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and §5.4 and D203: an unknown original statement date remains unknown.","mechanism":"src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:265 substitutes the article’s publication day and presents it to the matcher as the original statement date, although the article does not give the results announcement date."}
{"seq":1218,"lane":"B","class":"leak-treated-as-rumour","severity":"minor","evidence":"1218.json: “on Friday, VideoCardz spotted that following NBA 2K27's early access going live, a DLSS 'neural rendering' DLL was discovered in the build” and RenoDX modders got it working; B stores this account as tier “rumour”.","rule":"Signed standard §5.2 and §5.5 distinguish an unofficial implementation from an unconfirmed or anonymously sourced claim; source tier follows who confirmed the statement.","mechanism":"B appears to treat the leaked, unofficial nature of the software as uncertainty about the reported discovery and demonstration, despite the article naming the discoverer and modding community."}
{"seq":1218,"lane":"matching","class":"invented-statement-date","severity":"serious","evidence":"1218.json: the article says “on Friday, VideoCardz spotted” the DLL; B leaves original_day empty, but matching records said_day “2026-08-29” for e1.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and §5.4 and D203: an unknown original statement date is not replaced with the publication date.","mechanism":"src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:265 substitutes the article’s publication day as the matcher’s stated date, even though the source describes the discovery as occurring earlier."}
{"seq":1220,"lane":"B","class":"wrong-original-attribution","severity":"serious","evidence":"1220.json: “The early access build of NBA 2K27 shipped with a 158MB library called nvngx_dlssnr.dll” is stored with original_who “NBA 2K27”; the article says “VideoCardz spotted the file first”.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and §5.4: identify the original source or leave it unknown; do not invent an original speaker.","mechanism":"B puts the name of the game containing the file into the original-speaker field, rather than identifying the reported discoverer or leaving the source uncertain."}
{"seq":1220,"lane":"matching","class":"invented-statement-date","severity":"serious","evidence":"1220.json: “The RenoDX modding community had the library running inside Control the same day” has original_day “”, but matching records said_day “2026-08-29” for e3.","rule":"Signed standard §2 and §5.4 and D203: an unknown original statement date remains unknown.","mechanism":"src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:265 substitutes the publication day as the matcher’s stated date; the article gives a relative day but no calendar date for the modding event."}
{"summary":{"items_read":[1213,1214,1215,1216,1217,1218,1219,1220],"classes":{"lost-uncertainty":1,"same-article-evidence-duplicated":1,"invented-statement-date":5,"leak-treated-as-rumour":1,"wrong-original-attribution":1}}}